reole, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"CYMUz5KDEGI3Faqaz0skBw","review_id":"CFCtndjRRL5NxLSVEhMgaA","date":"2016-02-05T20:40:43","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.956725001335144,"text_excerpt":"I love Pete's. I go for lunch, dinner, happy hour. The bartenders are fabulous. There are only two beers on draft, though (NOLA Blonde and Abita Amber), but they do have plenty in bottles. The pub is spacious and swanky, not cramped like another restaurant within the Intercontinental Hotel. The food is fabulous. I've not had a bad thing. My favorites are the gumbo, drunken shrimp and grits, the pizza, any salad. Their burgers are thick and juicy and the fries are crisp. $10 lunch special where you pick two items. Good sized portions. You won't be disappointed here."},{"business_id":"CYMUz5KDEGI3Faqaz0skBw","review_id":"9HUy9QgQDGzsbRxDwggnhg","date":"2019-11-06T01:17:58","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9537341594696045,"text_excerpt":"We stayed in the Intercontinental, so eating at Pete's was just easy and convenient. We actually ate here twice and had a positive experience both times. The service was very good - and very friendly. The quesadillas were above average in flavor and size. Good stuff. They only have one burger on the menu and it is fantastic. Seriously. Probably one of the better burgers I've had in a long time. The french fries are also notably good. But the stand-out of this was the chips and salsa. You get three different types of salsa -- a sweet, a slightly spicy and a... well... something else. I don't know how to describe it, but it was saucy and tasted great. The only thing I'd call not above-avera..."},{"business_id":"CYMUz5KDEGI3Faqaz0skBw","review_id":"0QHxeIb8CbB5vM0eyqW7tg","date":"2015-12-22T20:42:31","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9436798095703125,"text_excerpt":"I came to pete's for lunch recently and was pleasantly surprised. I had the romaine salad and the club sandwich from the Pick 2 $10 lunch menu. The romaine salad was simple - romaine, shaved parmesan flakes, and dressing. And it was a good combination. The club sandwich had turkey, ham, bacon, and cheese, and was on ciabatta bread. Also simple. Also good. For $10, I was very happy with what I got."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"CYMUz5KDEGI3Faqaz0skBw","photo_id":"keWMk8xSiOo54UoNTLP1Tw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/keWMk8xSiOo54UoNTLP1Tw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8944061994552612},{"business_id":"CYMUz5KDEGI3Faqaz0skBw","photo_id":"BGOZMHHGwKWiDVFvgBLoXA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/BGOZMHHGwKWiDVFvgBLoXA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8944061994552612},{"business_id":"CYMUz5KDEGI3Faqaz0skBw","photo_id":"4PmhQMF6qCZrS_o9g4g7cw","label":"outside","image_url":